flowchart LR
  Cat[Cat approaching robot] --> Camera[Fixed external IR camera]
  Camera -->|RTSP over LAN| Vision[Python edge worker]
  Vision -->|visit event / idempotency key| API[ASP.NET Core API]
  Vision -->|limited clips| Media[(Local clip store)]
  API --> DB[(SQLite/PostgreSQL)]
  API --> Dashboard[Web dashboard]
  Dashboard -->|manual corrections| API
  Dataset[Verified labeled visit dataset] --> Trainer[Optional model training]
  API -.-> Dataset
  Trainer -->|versioned model| Vision
  Robot[Optional robot telemetry] -.-> API
